    "Play the game once through Madeira Dock: Steam then keeps its achievements here, and a banner shows each one you unlock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spiele das Spiel einmal über Madeira Dock: Steam speichert seine Erfolge dann hier, und ein Banner zeigt jeden, den du freischaltest."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Juega una vez con Madeira Dock: Steam guardará aquí sus logros y un aviso mostrará cada uno que desbloquees."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Madeira Dock으로 게임을 한 번 플레이하세요. 그러면 Steam이 여기에 도전 과제를 보관하고, 달성할 때마다 배너가 표시됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jogue uma vez pelo Madeira Dock: a Steam passa a guardar as conquistas aqui, e um aviso mostra cada uma que você desbloquear."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Запустите игру один раз через Madeira Dock: Steam сохранит её достижения здесь, а баннер покажет каждое полученное."
          }
        }
